r reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/highPriorityGesture(_:name:isEnabled:)":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"highPriorityGesture(_:name:isEnabled:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/highprioritygesture(_:name:isenabled:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/highPriorityGesture(_:name:isEnabled:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"highPriorityGesture"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"name"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isEnabled"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Swif